# Physical & Simulation Test Results

## How to use this file

Complete this document as the project is tested.

Do not invent results. Record the actual measured behaviour.

---

## Test Summary

| ID | Test | Expected Result | Actual Result | Pass/Fail |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| T01 | Temperature <= 18°C | Blue LED + buzzer | | |
| T02 | Temperature 19–23°C | Warning outputs OFF | | |
| T03 | Temperature >= 24°C | Red LED + buzzer | | |
| T04 | PIR detects movement | Lighting outputs activate | | |
| T05 | No movement | Lighting outputs return LOW | | |
| T06 | Reed switch active | Door LED responds | | |

